@startuml
title As-Is Sequence - Home Dashboard Read

actor User
participant Browser
participant HomeController
participant HomeDashboardService
participant BookRepository
participant MemberRepository
participant LoanRepository
database PostgreSQL

User -> Browser : GET /
Browser -> HomeController : request
HomeController -> HomeDashboardService : loadSummary()
HomeDashboardService -> BookRepository : findAllByOrderByIdDesc()
BookRepository -> PostgreSQL : select books
HomeDashboardService -> MemberRepository : findAllByOrderByIdDesc()
MemberRepository -> PostgreSQL : select members
HomeDashboardService -> LoanRepository : findAllWithBookAndMemberOrderByLoanedAtDesc()
LoanRepository -> PostgreSQL : select loans join books join members
HomeDashboardService -> HomeDashboardService : aggregate counts, overdue, member stats
HomeDashboardService --> HomeController : HomeDashboardSummary
HomeController --> Browser : render home/index

@enduml
